      {
        "id": "book001-b000869-p000-e2f888e020",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "土庚山势长，壬、亥朝来皆大旺。但得三湾并五曲，一湾抱处得荣昌。",
